Z||000000||sluppy123||06-12-2000||09:55 PM||||I've finally gotten some pictures of my new paint. I'm still putting her back together so no final pics yet. The car is a 87' GT that was black, the new paint is Galaxy Silver Metallic, Ground effects are painted dark Pewter metallic, Trim and mirrors are painted with GM Black Satin. <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=247832&a=6751238" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=247832&a=6751238</A> <P>Mods include- New Jasper engine, MSD ignition, K&N, Ported heads, intake & exhaust, No cat., Grand Am Brake swap, Rear sway bar, custom shock tower brace, Custom stereo and sub woffer, RSM side scoops, Soon to have Mr. Mikes leather(next week)<P>-Brian<BR>||||reg||10
